# ==============================================================================
# .dockerignore - EXCLUSION RULES FOR DOCKER BUILD CONTEXT
# Purpose: Prevent local dependencies, build artifacts, and sensitive data 
# from being copied into the Docker image, optimizing build speed and size.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Dependencies & Build Artifacts ---
# We must install dependencies fresh inside the container architecture
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
build
coverage

# --- Version Control & IDE Metadata ---
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.nx
.editorconfig

# --- Environment & Secrets ---
# CRITICAL: Never copy local .env files into the image build
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# --- System & Temporary Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
tmp
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Frontend Specifics ---
# Avoid copying heavy mobile assets if we are building backend
apps/clients/mobile_app/build
apps/clients/mobile_app/.dart_tool
apps/clients/mobile_app/android
apps/clients/mobile_app/ios
apps/clients/mobile_app/macos
apps/clients/mobile_app/windows
apps/clients/mobile_app/linux